--TEST--
`prepareRename` on a local's read answers the range of the variable with its `$`, because a local is renamed at every place its body writes it, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
var $total = 3;
echo $to<|>tal;
--REQUEST--
prepareRename
--EXPECT--
case.nvs:3:6-3:12
